{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Quest for the Albatross",
    "steam_appid": 3820940,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/03a42ee23d0fafe59420a947f9b562da.avif?t=1755522242\" width=950 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the magic of golf in a world where every stroke shapes fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest for the Albatross is a pixel art golf RPG set in a richly imagined fantasy world inspired by Tolkien. Journey across the land of Ace, where enchanted forests, warring kingdoms, and ancient magic collide on the fairway. Here, golf isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s a way of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When darkness threatens to consume the realm, you must rise\u2014not with sword and shield, but with clubs, courage, and a bit of magical finesse. Will you conquer your enemies on the green\u2026 or fall into the rough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/f7e99a554e009b596eb0f717cf5cec67.avif?t=1755522242\" width=600 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/a53d2163cc12e21055724f76042ee692.poster.avif?t=1755522242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/a53d2163cc12e21055724f76042ee692.webm?t=1755522242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/45d1496683ed6da97aac13fde588230b.avif?t=1755522242\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tee off on an epic quest where magic meets mastery on the fairway.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, the dwarven warrior named Lieth invented golf in the heat of battle. Since then, golf has evolved into a sacred tradition\u2014one where spells enhance swings, and matches decide the fate of kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new challenger, guided by Lieth\u2019s teachings and burdened by responsibility. As ancient evils stir and kingdoms prepare for war, you\u2019ll journey through spellbound biomes, challenge powerful rivals, and unlock the secrets of the fabled Albatross \u2014 a myth that few believe, and even fewer understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your swing will echo across history. Your decisions will shape the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/03984710ada90f0b37f6b12dcf9722af.avif?t=1755522242\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/82cae270052828f8d54dea9eafb47f0a.poster.avif?t=1755522242\" width=1274 height=706 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/82cae270052828f8d54dea9eafb47f0a.webm?t=1755522242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/82cae270052828f8d54dea9eafb47f0a.mp4?t=1755522242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/e36a1906e3a2c04878914443a16a4df5.avif?t=1755522242\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wizard\u2019s duel with irons and incantations\u2014this is golf like you\u2019ve never seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Meets Mechanics</strong><br>Unleash powerful spells mid-match to control the elements, alter your shots, and outplay your opponents. Will you warp the wind\u2026 or summon a fireball bunker trap?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golf is Combat</strong><br>From orcish duels to monster sieges, golf is the battlefield. Fight, race, and puzzle your way through unique game modes, each with its own twist on fantasy-infused golf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes for Every Hero</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong> \u2013 Experience traditional, tactical matches with RPG twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Mode</strong> \u2013 It\u2019s not about strokes\u2014it\u2019s about speed. Outrace your rivals to the hole!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Siege Mode</strong> \u2013 Fend off waves of magical beasts in tense defensive rounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Mode</strong> \u2013 Use trick shots and clever thinking to solve ancient magical contraptions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Arsenal</strong><br>Equip enchanted clubs and elemental balls to customize your strategy. Choose wisely\u2014your loadout could be the difference between par and peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Realm of Ace</strong><br>Traverse a sprawling world filled with haunted forests, sun-drenched cliffs, enchanted villages, and cursed courses\u2014each with their own lore, hazards, and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Mystery of the Albatross</strong><br>Legends speak of a force beyond comprehension. A perfect shot. A final challenge. Few have seen it. Fewer still have survived it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/d68f2b100ef8808631bc934e236124e7.avif?t=1755522242\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/374adb837f895e4b6ce2a32251098716.poster.avif?t=1755522242\" width=1274 height=706 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/374adb837f895e4b6ce2a32251098716.webm?t=1755522242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/374adb837f895e4b6ce2a32251098716.mp4?t=1755522242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><i>Fantasy, fairways, and fate\u2014your journey to the Albatross begins here.</i></strong><br><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/1fde15b9ebaad4bfeaa211535480254e.avif?t=1755522242\" width=600 height=114 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/03a42ee23d0fafe59420a947f9b562da.avif?t=1755522242\" width=950 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the magic of golf in a world where every stroke shapes fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest for the Albatross is a pixel art golf RPG set in a richly imagined fantasy world inspired by Tolkien. Journey across the land of Ace, where enchanted forests, warring kingdoms, and ancient magic collide on the fairway. Here, golf isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s a way of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When darkness threatens to consume the realm, you must rise\u2014not with sword and shield, but with clubs, courage, and a bit of magical finesse. Will you conquer your enemies on the green\u2026 or fall into the rough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/f7e99a554e009b596eb0f717cf5cec67.avif?t=1755522242\" width=600 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/a53d2163cc12e21055724f76042ee692.poster.avif?t=1755522242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/a53d2163cc12e21055724f76042ee692.webm?t=1755522242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/45d1496683ed6da97aac13fde588230b.avif?t=1755522242\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tee off on an epic quest where magic meets mastery on the fairway.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, the dwarven warrior named Lieth invented golf in the heat of battle. Since then, golf has evolved into a sacred tradition\u2014one where spells enhance swings, and matches decide the fate of kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new challenger, guided by Lieth\u2019s teachings and burdened by responsibility. As ancient evils stir and kingdoms prepare for war, you\u2019ll journey through spellbound biomes, challenge powerful rivals, and unlock the secrets of the fabled Albatross \u2014 a myth that few believe, and even fewer understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your swing will echo across history. Your decisions will shape the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/03984710ada90f0b37f6b12dcf9722af.avif?t=1755522242\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/82cae270052828f8d54dea9eafb47f0a.poster.avif?t=1755522242\" width=1274 height=706 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/82cae270052828f8d54dea9eafb47f0a.webm?t=1755522242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/82cae270052828f8d54dea9eafb47f0a.mp4?t=1755522242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/e36a1906e3a2c04878914443a16a4df5.avif?t=1755522242\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wizard\u2019s duel with irons and incantations\u2014this is golf like you\u2019ve never seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Meets Mechanics</strong><br>Unleash powerful spells mid-match to control the elements, alter your shots, and outplay your opponents. Will you warp the wind\u2026 or summon a fireball bunker trap?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golf is Combat</strong><br>From orcish duels to monster sieges, golf is the battlefield. Fight, race, and puzzle your way through unique game modes, each with its own twist on fantasy-infused golf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes for Every Hero</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong> \u2013 Experience traditional, tactical matches with RPG twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Mode</strong> \u2013 It\u2019s not about strokes\u2014it\u2019s about speed. Outrace your rivals to the hole!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Siege Mode</strong> \u2013 Fend off waves of magical beasts in tense defensive rounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Mode</strong> \u2013 Use trick shots and clever thinking to solve ancient magical contraptions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Arsenal</strong><br>Equip enchanted clubs and elemental balls to customize your strategy. Choose wisely\u2014your loadout could be the difference between par and peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Realm of Ace</strong><br>Traverse a sprawling world filled with haunted forests, sun-drenched cliffs, enchanted villages, and cursed courses\u2014each with their own lore, hazards, and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Mystery of the Albatross</strong><br>Legends speak of a force beyond comprehension. A perfect shot. A final challenge. Few have seen it. Fewer still have survived it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/d68f2b100ef8808631bc934e236124e7.avif?t=1755522242\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/374adb837f895e4b6ce2a32251098716.poster.avif?t=1755522242\" width=1274 height=706 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/374adb837f895e4b6ce2a32251098716.webm?t=1755522242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/374adb837f895e4b6ce2a32251098716.mp4?t=1755522242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><i>Fantasy, fairways, and fate\u2014your journey to the Albatross begins here.</i></strong><br><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820940/extras/1fde15b9ebaad4bfeaa211535480254e.avif?t=1755522242\" width=600 height=114 /></span></p>",
